    "Expected values come from the item tooltips (CoA Tavern, SUB/db.exil.es 2026-10-04, AscensionDB WDB 2026-09-04) and the client Spell.dbc, not from the implementation. Each check runs for the CoA pet classes Primalist (spirit beast), Witch Hunter (Houndmaster spec, Shadowhound) and Tinker (Mechano-Bear).",
    "431328 (required level 70) reads 'Increases your hunter pet's attack power by 74, armor by 515 and Stamina by 55'. Equip aura",
    "2127044 carries the three values as DUMMY effects 0..2. The pet's attack power must rise by at least 74 (owner scaling adds a",
    "little on top) and its maximum health must rise, also after the pet is summoned again. Stock 31328 reads +70 attack power",
    "and, as on live (AscensionDB WDB 2026-08-05, Rexxar dump 2026-11-21), wears equip aura 2128044."
  ],
